{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 86150, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 61308, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "国际服未来WB标准阵容预览", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1629362907, "updated_at": 1688112601, "updated_uid": 55158, "comment_at": 1688726654, "last_at": 1688728883, "comment_count": 107, "status": 1, "summary": "1.假设国际服未出的天子全部按日服原版技能实装。2.假设国际服世界王技能完全按日服原版实装。3.注意是标准队伍。对于氪佬有些天子可以不上；萌新可能连天子都凑不齐。4.不再出预攻略，转为阵容预览+更新后", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_606/h_858/202/55158/2023/5/29/446090.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_605/h_855/202/55158/2023/5/29/236484.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_598/h_800/202/55158/2023/5/29/144670.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 62, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 181453, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 22, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 86150, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>1.<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">假设</span>国际服未出的天子全部<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">按日服原版技能</span>实装。</div><div>2.<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">假设</span>国际服世界王技能完全<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">按日服原版</span>实装。</div><div>3.注意是标准队伍。对于氪佬有些天子可以不上；萌新可能连天子都凑不齐。</div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">4.不再出预攻略，转为阵容预览+更新后第二天中午前出实战攻略的形式。只要对着阵容预览提前练一下天子即可。</span></div></span><div><br></div><div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">红莲火WB</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"606\" data-height=\"858\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_606/h_858/202/55158/2023/5/29/446090.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_606/h_858/202/55158/2023/5/29/446090.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\"></font></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">TS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">：剩余hp最多的敌方优先，</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">体</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">连打、造成猛毒（<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\">每2秒造成200持续伤害，回复量-50%，无法缩减或延长减益效果</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">），持续14秒；增益吸收（</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 0.37333rem;\">从目标移除一个增益，己方drive量表增加+50</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）</span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\">SS</font><font face=\"宋体\">：减益中的敌方优先，</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\">体</font><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">连打、造成诱惑（<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\">目标增益效果无效，除特定移除技能外无法移除</span>）</font></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">；猛毒增幅（<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;text-align:left;\">增加猛毒持续伤害，减少更多回复量</span>），持续16秒</font></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">DS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">：敌方前排全体造成伤害，造成受到的持续伤害+300，持续16秒；自身ds量表增加。</font></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></div><div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">敌方队长技</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">战场</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">buff</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">：获得减益回避率</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+30%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、非弱点属性技能防御</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+80%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、技能充能速度</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+20%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、弱点防御</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">-40%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、无力化无效（免疫石化、沉默、混乱、眩晕、睡眠、重击）、免疫诱惑、免疫感电</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">注：</div><div class=\"div-img\">1.猛毒增幅为猛毒提供+200的每跳伤害，如果再中了ds的+300，就会每跳700的持续伤害；同时猛毒增幅将治疗量的-50%提升为-75%。</div><div class=\"div-img\">2.ds的ds量表增加仅增加6%，总ds量表为3000。</div><div class=\"div-img\">3.被增益吸收的增益会直接消失，boss不会获得。</div><div class=\"div-img\">4.持续回血如弗蕾亚的ss可以被增益吸收，同时瞬间回血若恰好对上增益吸收也可以被增益吸收。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">队伍1</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"0\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><img data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618873746_90246811.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele lazy-img\" img-count=\"7\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618873746_90246811.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605681463321_69639550.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele lazy-img\" img-count=\"8\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605681463321_69639550.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"font-weight: 400; width: 69px; height: 69px; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/236746/2023/3/26/807473.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1641977132754_65479703.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele lazy-img\" img-count=\"9\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1641977132754_65479703.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; h