nt=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_246/202/63428/2022/11/16/529592.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 69px; height: 69px;\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"246\"><img data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617711219_50134595.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617711219_50134595.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"11\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/8/14/913594.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/8/14/913594.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"12\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/4/27/188402.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 16px; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img data-width=\"109\" data-height=\"115\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1595404228745_73089316.jpg?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1595404228745_73089316.jpg?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"4\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/1/28/375887.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 16px; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"15\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); width: 69px; height: 69px; font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/236746/2023/5/21/22766.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 16px; width: 69px; height: 69px;\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele lazy-img\" img-count=\"16\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" lazy=\"loaded\" style=\"width: 69px; height: 69px; font-size: 0.37333rem; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/5/22/134257.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"width: 69px; height: 69px;\"></div></div></div><div><br></div><div>适用于会死人的情况，干脆直接采用时停，从根本上解决问题。</div><div>鲁茵的作用是保证减益的覆盖率，附魔及魂卡达到要求后可以被替换，优先换成第三把水刀或者尼曼。</div><div>光相机主要是给光击剑、光琴、vva加速，如果队伍还是会死人，光相机和鲁茵其中一个换成奶就行。</div><div>光相机的位置也可以是火人鱼，帮助解魅惑的同时给刀补条。光相机的下位替代是光莫娜。</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">队伍2</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:r